WEBVTT

00:02.200 --> 00:03.280
There was originally someone

00:03.360 --> 00:05.360
Who might help us find evidence

00:05.480 --> 00:07.120
The son of Qing Province's governor

00:07.200 --> 00:08.600
Guo Xuan

00:13.800 --> 00:15.800
But this person is already dead

00:16.680 --> 00:18.080
Give me more time

00:18.200 --> 00:20.533
I will definitely think of a way

00:21.080 --> 00:22.920
Let's think of a way together
